flowchart TD
  A{Is the question about one run or many runs?} -->|One run| B{Which hop acted?}
  A -->|Many runs| C{Is it spend or capacity?}
  B --> D[Trace spans with one trace ID]
  C -->|Spend| E[Usage and cost reports]
  C -->|Capacity| F[Response headers and retry-after]
  D --> G{Prompt text allowed?}
  G -->|No| H[Metadata only content mode]
  G -->|Yes| I[Full content mode within limits]
  E --> J{Platform is Claude Platform on AWS?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Console pages only]
  J -->|No| L[Admin API key report calls]
